bind Cargo Accept: Identifier Cargo
bind Cargo Examine: Identifier Cargo, Identifier Inspector, Result Examination
bind Cargo Document: Identifier Cargo, State Documentation
bind Cargo Scan: Identifier Cargo, Weight Cargo
bind Cargo Clear: Identifier Cargo
bind Cargo Hold: Identifier Cargo
bind Findings Document: Identifier Cargo, Item Found Prohibited
bind Authorities Notify: Identifier Cargo, Item Found Prohibited, State Notification
bind Cargo Release: Identifier Cargo
bind Documentation Archive: Identifier Cargo, State Documentation
bind Cargo Dispatch: Identifier Cargo
bind Entry Log: Identifier Cargo
Identifier Cargo: integer between 1 and 999999
Weight Cargo: float between 0.1 and 10000
Identifier Inspector: integer between 1 and 9999
Result Examination: Clear, Hold
Item Found Prohibited: Yes, No
State Notification: Notified, Not Notified
State Documentation: Completed, Incomplete
